ge","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"テキストオブジェクトは任意のが来る想定","ts":"1632305580.213500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MR=pJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a1e09743-5163-4675-8c67-b5ab8d87d79b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"テキストオブジェクトのほうをいじれるなら…？","ts":"1632305563.213200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/4P54"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a744645f-c9c7-4f89-8063-55bdb48c660d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ドットリピート API があればカーソル位置保存してから `g@` 起動するようなの仕込めるんだが…逆に言うと repeat.vim に依存すればたぶんできる","ts":"1632305537.212600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"undwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"054ac0d9-fc12-43ec-bf3a-c83eff1f7655","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ないんですよね…","ts":"1632305510.212100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"munen","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"roUxz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f18083b-6108-4f04-854a-af40d0227ca5","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"operatorfunc 実行時点でカーソル位置が ``[` に移動するの知らなかった\n代わりに```` に入る、とかでもないんですよね","ts":"1632305497.211800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5aVL6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0e26a08-1a33-4b79-9b1c-7dcb42d169ad","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これも `CursorMoved` にイベント仕込んで常にトレースすれば取れなくもないんですけど、ドットリピートのためだけに `CursorMoved` 仕込むのか…? みたいになっています","ts":"1632305311.210400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2lI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91a40ac1-298c-45df-9894-a36061022228","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分だったら挿入ノーマルでドット発動など知るかって言いますねw","ts":"1632305284.209600","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1632305303.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tn=Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b17e1026-d7ce-443b-8f92-f1008ac235b0","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"似たような話で、operatorfunc でオペレータ開始時点のカーソル位置を取る方法ってないですかね…? operatorfunc 実行時点だとカーソル位置が ``[` に移動してしまっていて、`g@` の前に保存すれば初回は取れるんですけど、ドットリピートすると保存部分が走らないので取れないんですよね…","ts":"1632305274.209000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I5Ck"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b35383b-a5c9-4004-9822-3f43c0370412","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"でも不可能ではないことがわかってよかった","ts":"1632305254.208100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p8Mw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9702c862-5840-423b-a211-40c043f836bb","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"やりたいことに対してかなりレアなケースなのでそのためだけにグローバルに safestate を仕込むべきか、というのはあったりしますw","ts":"1632305233.207400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Wmck"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c5eca2b-7173-4fd7-939a-6328ebcb95e1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"おっよかった","ts":"1632305020.205300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kan","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]},{"name":"sha","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oPB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1349014-ad14-4795-851c-550af461a0d6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"できたかもです。以下ように SafeState をしこんでおくと、operatorfunc 内で `g:mode` が `i` になるのを確認できました (マッピングの実装の仕方にもよるかもしれませんが)\nドットコマンドはノーマルモード系列でしか使えないので結果として挿入ノーマルモードで呼ばれたことがわかる\n```augroup my-SafeState\n  autocmd!\n  autocmd SafeState * let g:mode = mode(1)\naugroup END```","ts":"1632304988.204900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ELK0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5cf7fe4-1a9c-4ab8-b494-82408b2e2c2a","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"あーなるほど、やってみます :cat-dogeza-mike:","ts":"1632303702.202000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JqI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acd6d42f-f87b-4520-be45-afab81021b91","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"特定のモードにいるということを記録しておいてオペレータ内で使うのを想定して話していました","ts":"1632303610.201000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZnVY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"085e6121-9a51-452a-b3a3-a7d71fcd3bfb","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"なるほど ModeChanged","ts":"1632303602.200400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PoW5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02220bcf-3530-48c3-89fd-d44fdbaf2261","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vim限定でよければ最近入ったModeChanged使えないのかな","ts":"1632303572.199100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YWq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f905ae20-4ba1-4725-b3be-3c7f00203ff4","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"safestate ってどこで仕込むことを想定されてます？","ts":"1632303563.198900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CKZgD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0ab81b3-0a34-42b2-a573-d5f33ba9a5e0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"本当だ、ないな。しらなかった","ts":"1632303487.197300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KYJO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91f428be-8f6d-4711-9898-dbadc341ab27","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ためしたかんじ textobj はだめそうでした… (やはり `mode(1) = no` になってしまう)","ts":"1632303446.196600","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1632303482.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hIsn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"962b7ce0-9824-4f06-9afe-73dd85fd0d97","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"そういえば SafeState って Neovim には無い気がするんですよね。うらやましい","ts":"1632302928.195900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Sddq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EA50F5BB-40DD-4E9D-825E-38C5CE101196","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"まあ確かにとりあえず試してみて、ですよね。こういうの。","ts":"1632302860.195600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Br0+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea634492-1508-4eca-a240-fbb45228d111","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"挿入ノーマルで呼ばれるかが分からんのですよね","ts":"1632302495.194300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qe8S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B9B0CB86-C532-4334-9EF9-2953EC04A392","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"オペレーター待機中はトリガーされない、となっているので無理かも...?","ts":"1632302397.193800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bGc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5233d10f-cf9a-411e-8cce-cfbec34af431","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"なるほど SafeState。ちょっとやってみます","ts":"1632302369.193200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1k=8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b8b23ad-a163-46d0-8c44-00c0e31c2034","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ちょっと今試せないですが","ts":"1632302134.192600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y19H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f539378f-bc1b-40b5-84cf-3c15e46a53ab","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これどうなんでしたっけ","ts":"1632302126.192300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ruh"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *SafeState*\nSafeState                       何も保留されておらず、ユーザーの文字入力を待つ\n                                とき。\n                                次の場合はトリガーされない:\n                                - オペレータ待機中\n                                - レジスタが \"r で入力された\n                                - コマンドの実行途中\n                                - マップの実行中\n                                - 先行入力がある\n                                - 挿入モード補完がアクティブ\n                                - コマンドライン補完がアクティブ\n                                `mode()` を使用して、Vimの状態を確認できる。\n                                それは以下かもしれない:\n                                - ビジュアルモード\n                                - ノーマルモード\n                                - 挿入モード\n                                - コマンドラインモード\n                                やりたいことによっては、`state()` でさらに\n                                チェックすることもできる。例えば、画面がメッ\n                                セージのためにスクロールされたかどうか。\n```","ts":"1632302121.192000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"29d4f019-d1b9-4a39-932b-24f759b8d09f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h safestate","ts":"1632302120.191900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"knJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45e583ee-1937-4aae-9626-1ca334c04edf","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"なるほどテキストオブジェクト","ts":"1632301986.190700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yB59y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"329dd796-92d3-4d44-905a-8eef66bcb120","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"テキストオブジェクトのほうをいじれるならやりようがあるかもしれませんが（それでもうまくいく保証はない）","ts":"1632301881.189900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ygz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b4bcaed-98bc-4dbc-9fe2-1af2d697146b","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"ドットリピートの場合、たぶん operatorfunc がユーザーが介入できる最初の場所なんですよね。そして operatorfunc の中では `mode(1) = no` になってしまう","ts":"1632301853.189500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oMy7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c2783ee-0aaf-4105-be54-c4e66263bd32","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ドットリピートが使われた場所を取ろうと思ったら operatorfunc 内に仕込むしかなさそう…そしてそれだと取れないのか…（やったことなかった）","ts":"1632301853.189400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f4V8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f98321f-2c9a-48ce-91d9-f4c7cc2ea474","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"絶対通る場所にmode()置いたら取得できないのかな","ts":"1632301542.184700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m+a4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FF4F7F52-22AC-4DB4-BC2C-3C86BBF06251","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"あーなるほど、ドットリピートかどうかじゃなくて、ドットリピートが使われたのがノーマルモードからなのかそれとも挿入ノーマルモードからなのか、の判定がしたいという話ですか\n勘違いしてましたすみません","ts":"1632301472.183100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cat-dogeza-mike","count":1,"users":["U01H161HVPS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sWz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a0facc5-6d5d-454a-a182-d7d8318c94f6","type":"message","user":"U01H161HVPS","text":"初回にノーマルモードで呼び出されて、そのつぎに挿入ノーマルモードからドットコマンドで呼び出されたときに、ドットリピートで呼ばれたことはわかるが初回はノーマルモードだったということになってしまっているという感じです (説明が難しい)","ts":"1632301322.180100","edited":{"user":"U01H161HVPS","ts":"1632301477.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z8WJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e01c3cb4-c55c-4374-97f0-607beb7499d9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あ、でも peridot.vim のときはインターフェースが関数だったから情報が取れたのかも（忘れた）","ts":"1632301277.178800","team":"